[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5344.31, "timestamp": "01:29:04", "text": "糟糕。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5354.709, "timestamp": "01:29:14", "text": "月亮把那些蠢货都毁灭了。孩子们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5358.55, "timestamp": "01:29:18", "text": "骑士把你干掉了，兄弟。什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5360.47, "timestamp": "01:29:20", "text": "她要死了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5361.99, "timestamp": "01:29:21", "text": "那本杂志肯定不会失手。绝不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5365.87, "timestamp": "01:29:25", "text": "头脑。他做到了。哦，糟糕。是真的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5368.55, "timestamp": "01:29:28", "text": "该死的火警！我要抓住他！我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5369.91, "timestamp": "01:29:29", "text": "我要上去了。我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5371.43, "timestamp": "01:29:31", "text": "抓住他。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5373.11, "timestamp": "01:29:33", "text": "火箭。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5383.47, "timestamp": "01:29:43", "text": "我很惊讶地发现没有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5387.43, "timestamp": "01:29:47", "text": "呃，巴基。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5389.51, "timestamp": "01:29:49", "text": "是的，巴基明白了，人们需要瞄准。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5391.51, "timestamp": "01:29:51", "text": "你知道。蜘蛛现在很痛苦。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5393.91, "timestamp": "01:29:53", "text": "啊。我的天啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5396.07, "timestamp": "01:29:56", "text": "我的意思是，他被击中了。当然，你需要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5398.31, "timestamp": "01:29:58", "text": "目的。"}]